[ ] - No tests: There are no unit tests or integration tests implemented.

[ ] - Simple user interface: The UI needs improvement to provide a more interactive and user-friendly experience.

[♥] - Missing advanced features: Features like drug expiry alerts, low stock notifications, and transaction history are not implemented.

[♥] - Security: Ensure proper password protection and prevent SQL injection attacks.

[ ] - Performance and scalability improvements: Support pagination for large datasets, optimize queries, and prepare the database for scalability.

[ ] - Weak internal code documentation: Use comments to explain complex logic within the code.

[ ] - No Docker setup or demo version: A demo or containerized version would make it easier for others to test the project.

[ ] - Missing error logging: Logging is needed to track and debug issues effectively.